00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:10,611
Add presbyopia, the stiffening lens of age; astigmatism, an unevenly curved cornea; and cataract, a lens gone cloudy.

2
00:00:10,611 --> 00:00:20,533
Focusing on near objects, accommodation, happens when the ciliary muscle contracts, the ligaments slacken, and the elastic lens rounds up.

